            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "A report of the first six years of the Northern California Environmental Grassroots Fund, which was launched in 2003 to energize and empower the environmental grassroots through small grants, coaching, training, workshops and other services. Program officers at the Compton Foundation, the Richard and Rhonda Goldman Fund, and Rose Foundation created the Grassroots Fund as an avenue for foundations to effectively direct resources to grassroots activists and communities.",
